---
import RoundButton from '@/components/RoundButton.astro';
import ShareLinks from '@/components/ShareLinks.astro';
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/site.config';
---

<PageLayout title="About" description={`About ${SITE.title}.`} hideTitle>
  <p class="intro feather" slot="lead">{SITE.intro}</p>

  <p>
    Lone Voice is a place for the things that don't fit anywhere else: ideas I haven't finished thinking, and
    feelings I haven't quite found the words for. Writing them down is how I work out what I think.
  </p>
  <p>
    Most posts are short notes. Now and then there is a longer piece, a photo, or a link to something worth
    reading, and the <a href="/books/">books</a> page keeps a list of what I have read, year by year. Posts are
    gathered by <a href="/topics/">topic</a>, and the <a href="/posts/">posts</a> page lists all of them in order.
    There is no schedule: I write when there is something to say.
  </p>
  <p>
    This blog is anonymous on purpose. There is no name, no photo and no byline, only the writing. There are no
    comments, accounts or advertisements, and the site doesn't track its readers. To read more, see the{' '}
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> and the{' '}
    <a href="/content-policy/">content policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>follow along</h2>
  <RoundButton href="/rss.xml" icon="rss" text="subscribe with RSS" />
  <ShareLinks />
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    margin-block-end: var(--space-l);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-light);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .intro {
      margin-block-end: var(--space-xl);
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    }
  }
</style>
